Sharknado is a action, comedy, horror film directed by Anthony C. Ferrante.

3
00:12:17,142 --> 00:12:23,142
A freak hurricane hits Los Angeles, causing man-eating sharks to be scooped up
in tornadoes and flooding the city with shark-infested seawater.

4
